{"doc_id": "84f6538008a9ae3b9281d3fc4e9177d2d9d18f40b8a4021e05970c16411bb2dc", "extractor_version": "0.3.0", "schema_version": "1.1.0", "field": "performance_bond", "status": "present", "value_ja": "契約保証金は、免除する。\nただし、契約を締結する者が契約を履行しないこととなるおそれがあると認めるときは、契約保証金又はこれに代える担保の納付を求めることがある。", "normalized": {"status": "waived_with_proviso", "rate_percent": null}, "value_en": "Waived, provided that a performance bond or equivalent security may be required if there is a risk that the contractor will not perform the contract.", "citations": ["p2_s17", "p2_s18"], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "web", "model": "gemini-web", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-web"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-l1"}], "agreement": false, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}, {"name": "citations_exist", "passed": true}, {"name": "field_applicable", "passed": true}, {"name": "value_in_citation", "passed": true}, {"name": "values_roundtrip", "passed": true}, {"name": "heading_cue", "passed": true}], "reviewed_by": "claude_code", "review_note": "accepted A; p2_s17 waives the performance bond and p2_s18 adds a proviso (a bond may be asked if there is a risk of non-performance), so waived_with_proviso. B drops the proviso.", "final_state": "silver_model_reviewed", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": "web"}}
{"doc_id": "84f6538008a9ae3b9281d3fc4e9177d2d9d18f40b8a4021e05970c16411bb2dc", "extractor_version": "0.3.0", "schema_version": "1.1.0", "field": "tax_basis", "status": "present", "value_ja": "ア 落札決定に当たっては、入札書に記載された金額に当該金額の100分の10に相当する額を加算した金額（当該金額に１円未満の端数があるときは、その端数金額を切り捨てた金額）をもって落札価格とするので、入札に参加する者は、消費税等に係る課税事業者であるか免税事業者であるかを問わず、見積もった契約金額の110分の100に相当する金額を入札書に記載すること。", "normalized": {"basis": "bid_excludes_tax"}, "value_en": "At award, 10% is added to the bid amount; bidders must enter 100/110 of the estimated contract amount on the bid form (excluding consumption tax).", "citations": ["p3_s6"], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "web", "model": "gemini-web", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-web"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-l1"}], "agreement": true, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}, {"name": "citations_exist", "passed": true}, {"name": "field_applicable", "passed": true}, {"name": "value_in_citation", "passed": true}, {"name": "values_roundtrip", "passed": true}, {"name": "heading_cue", "passed": true}], "reviewed_by": "claude_code", "review_note": "accepted A; p3_s6: same 100/110 wording, so bid_excludes_tax. A quotes the whole sentence exactly; B's shortened quote is not found in the sentence.", "final_state": "silver_model_reviewed", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": "web"}}
